{
  "description": "Additive library-index preset attributes: category (Category slug), favorite (bool), tags ([str]). 'roundtrip' cases assert an entry serializes and parses back identically; 'old_index_defaults' asserts an entry dict missing the new keys parses with defaults (additive back-compat, schema stays 1); 'category_census' pins the per-category counts helper. Regenerate: python3 tools/gen_vectors.py (from the repo root).",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "roundtrip_lib00",
      "entry_json": {
        "id": "lib00",
        "name": "Pad One",
        "sha256": "ab53b438bbc557a4a87a03f1adb68c9f024f15026ce2413af15258a26059210d",
        "meta_hex": "080000000000000033",
        "slot": 0,
        "added_at": "2026-09-01T00:00:00",
        "tags": [
          "ambient",
          "pad"
        ],
        "category": "pad",
        "favorite": true
      },
      "expected": {
        "category": "pad",
        "favorite": true,
        "tags": [
          "ambient",
          "pad"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "roundtrip_lib01",
      "entry_json": {
        "id": "lib01",
